WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.780
Hello, my name is Lan-Anh Ngo and

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:07.860
I'm a product manager

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:09.700
for safety
laser scanners.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:12.200
Today, I would like
to present to you

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.340
our latest accessory,
our alignment aid.

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:17.020
The alignment aid is

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:18.600
a converted light curtain

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.260
which helps you
to visualize

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:22.420
the scan plane
of the scanner.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:25.040
The alignment
aid consists of

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:27.780
21 IR receiver elements

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:30.480
which are located 15
millimeters apart.

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:32.600
When IR light is detected,

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.160
the LEDs turn red.

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:38.790
The grreat thing is: It is now

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:40.470
possible to visualize

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:42.410
the scan plane
of the scanner

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:44.870
also at large distances.

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:47.270
Therefore, it is easy

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:47.870
to adjust

00:00:47.870 --> 00:00:50.070
the mounting position
of the scanner.

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:52.390
Additionally,
you also have

00:00:52.390 --> 00:00:53.790
an aid indicator on

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:55.830
the alignment bar itself.

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:58.670
The alignment bar
is battery-powered.

00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:00.250
You can easily charge

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:03.330
the alignment bar with
a Mini-USB cable.

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:05.130
It is very portable. 

00:01:05.130 --> 00:01:07.070
Due to its compact size,

00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:08.550
it's easy to put

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:12.050
the alignment bar in
a bagpack or bag.

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:16.690
And most importantly:
It is quiet.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:20.510
I hope really that
you like the product.

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:22.790
You can find the
article online at

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:24.310
sick.com .Thank

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:25.850
you very much for
your attention, and

00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:28.050
see you next time.

